{
  "declaredLength": 2336,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "只要和密阿雷的廚師們聊天，\n這個名字就會登場……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n吉普索你究竟是何方神聖？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EA8981548C5BC6963F96F776845EDA5E2B5011804A5929FF0C000A9019500B540D5B575C316703767B58342026202600100001BE00000A5409666E7D224F607A767ADF662F4F5565B9795E8056FF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我只是個在密阿雷\n長大的小混混。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621153EA662F500B57285BC6963F96F7000A9577592776845C0F6DF76DF7300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因為我和為了讓吃下去\n就會消失的東西變得更加美味，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n仍不計辛勞的廚師相遇……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E070BA6211548C70BA4E868B9354034E0B53BB000A5C3167036D88593176846771897F8B8A5F9766F452A07F8E5473FF0C00100001BE00000A4ECD4E0D8A088F9B52DE76845EDA5E2B76F890472026202600100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以開始變得全心全意地面對烹飪。\n事情就這麼簡單。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 568,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5958B59CB8B8A5F9751685FC35168610F573097625C0D70F998EA3002000A4E8B60C55C3190199EBC7C2155AE300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且說到講究，\n你也有自己的堅持吧。<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n可頌的烘烤火侯和鹽分拿捏，\n都是最高水準。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 628,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E148AAA52308B1B7A76FF0C000A4F604E5F670981EA5DF17684580563015427300200100001BE01000A53EF980C768470D870E4706B4FAF548C9E7D520662FF634FFF0C000A90FD662F67009AD86C346E96300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 48
    },
    {
      "displayText": "烹飪是科學。\n只要遵守數字和步驟，就不會失敗。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70F998EA662F79D15B783002000A53EA898190755B8865785B57548C6B659A5FFF0C5C314E0D670359316557300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我已經鍛鍊到能以1度為單位\n來調整寶可夢的火屬性招式了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 780,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E1462115DF27D93935B934A523080FD4EE500315EA670BA55AE4F4D000A4F868ABF65745BF653EF59227684706B5C6C602762DB5F0F4E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 35
    },
    {
      "displayText": "厲害！<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n很明顯，你的這手本事\n讓你成為一個強大的訓練家。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53B25BB3FF0100100001BE01000A5F88660E986FFF0C4F6076849019624B672C4E8B000A8B934F60621070BA4E00500B5F37592776848A137DF45BB6300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "正是如此！\n火力在對戰上也是重要的要素。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6B63662F59826B64FF01000A706B529B57285C0D62304E0A4E5F662F91CD8981768489817D20300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "對吃的東西太過講究，\n很麻煩吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 976,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5C0D540376846771897F592A904E8B1B7A76FF0C000A5F889EBB71695427300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "辛苦工作之後吃的飯，\n還不是吃什麼都香？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8F9B82E65DE54F5C4E4B5F8C5403768498EFFF0C000A90844E0D662F54034EC09EBC90FD9999FF1F00100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "古麗茲！\n妳能和我並肩作戰嗎？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1072,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53E49E978332FF01000A59B380FD548C62114E2680A94F5C623055CEFF1F00100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可以啊。反正打對戰活動活動筋骨之後，\n也是吃什麼都香。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1112,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF4EE5554A300253CD6B6362535C0D62306D3B52D56D3B52D57B4B9AA84E4B5F8CFF0C000A4E5F662F54034EC09EBC90FD9999300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 32
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳和我一起戰鬥吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB00100003110000FF01014F6059B3548C62114E008D7762309B255427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "當然好",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "75767136597D0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 1228,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會在對戰場等<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的，\n麻煩<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211670357285C0D623058347B4900100003110000FF01014F6059B37684FF0C000A9EBB716900100003110000FF01014F6059B34E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請和我一起打出一場\n令人發麻的刺激對戰吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB548C62114E008D77625351FA4E005834000A4EE44EBA767C9EBB7684523A6FC05C0D62305427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 26
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0012>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00120000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了告訴吉普索我有多感動，\n我想打寶可夢對戰！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1372,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E86544A8A345409666E7D2262116709591A611F52D5FF0C000A621160F362535BF653EF59225C0D6230FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 28
    },
    {
      "displayText": "陪我們打場對戰嘛！\n這也是為了古歷。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "966A62115011625358345C0D6230561BFF01000A90194E5F662F70BA4E8653E46B77300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我會贏的！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1476,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167038D0F7684FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 6
    },
    {
      "displayText": "請等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1488,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8ACB7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不能只是冒著煙，\n得熊熊燃燒才行！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1500,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D80FD53EA662F519284577159FF0C000A5F97718A718A71C371D2624D884CFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "噴火龍啊，吐出黑暗的火焰吧！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5674706B9F8D554AFF0C541051FA9ED166977684706B71305427FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳到底想做什麼……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1584,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100003110000FF01014F6059B352305E9560F3505A4EC09EBC2026202600100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我要燒掉<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳的一切！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1624,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6211898171D2638900100003110000FF01014F6059B376844E005207FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 20
    },
    {
      "displayText": "拜託了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1664,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62DC8A174E86300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1684,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了燦爛地燃燒到最後一刻，\n用超級進化猛烈燃燒吧，噴火龍！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1696,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E8671E6721B573071C371D2523067005F8C4E00523BFF0C000A75288D857D1A90325316731B70C871C371D25427FF0C5674706B9F8DFF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 34
    },
    {
      "displayText": "為了作為新咖啡的一員重獲新生，\n我要讓你們看看燃燒生命的超級進化！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1764,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "70BA4E864F5C70BA65B05496556176844E0054E191CD737265B0751FFF0C000A621189818B934F605011770B770B71C371D2751F547D76848D857D1A90325316FF0100100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "盔甲鳥，拜託你了。\n讓我當個堂堂的男子漢吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1840,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "76D475329CE5FF0C62DC8A174F604E863002000A8B9362117576500B58025802768475375B506F225427300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿 ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00200000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "雖然我輸了，但我讓\n吉普索見識到我燃燒的靈魂了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "96D6713662118F384E86FF0C4F4662118B93000A5409666E7D22898B8B585230621171C371D2768497489B424E86300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在我的心中，\n正熊熊燃起一把廚師之火。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1968,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE5728621176845FC34E2DFF0C000A6B63718A718A71C38D774E00628A5EDA5E2B4E4B706B300200100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啦好啦，\n這是<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿā你妳陪我們對戰的謝禮。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 2020,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D5566597D5566FF0C000A9019662F00100003110000FF01014F6059B3966A621150115C0D623076848B1D79AE300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>獲得了\n另一種顏色的古歷裝扮廚師裝組合！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000073725F974E86000A53E64E007A2E984F8272768453E46B7788DD626E5EDA5E2B88DD7D445408FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "像古歷那樣的髮型\n好像也不錯呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 2132,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "50CF53E46B7790A36A2376849AEE578B000A597D50CF4E5F4E0D932F5462300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好的邂逅，\n會引領人前往好的方向……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D768490829005FF0C000A67035F1598184EBA524D5F80597D768465B954112026202600100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不論烹飪還是對戰，\n我都想登峰造極！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0017>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8AD670F998EA9084662F5C0D6230FF0C000A621190FD60F3767B5CF090206975FF0100100002011400170000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "現在的話一定吃什麼都香。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0018>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73FE572876848A714E005B9A54034EC09EBC90FD9999300200100002011400180000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 17
    },
    {
      "displayText": "活著就少不了吃呢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 2308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6D3B84575C315C114E0D4E8654035462300200100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    }
  ],
